      "content": "Sana's REST API for the Sana AI knowledge/learning platform. Programmatic access to users, groups, programs, assignments, courses, paths, teamspaces, reporting/Insights, and xAPI statements. Authentication is OAuth 2.0 client credentials returning a bearer token; GET requests require the `read` scope and write requests require the `write` scope. The API is served per tenant at https://<domain>.sana.ai.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Sana API Documentation",
